{"type":"text","timestamp":1788461632943,"sessionID":"ses_f9761531dffeO0JQ36mOI7MVT9","part":{"id":"prt_0689ec8a5001r5H4CtravmaZCu","messageID":"msg_0689ec7b90019f9GXoePM2P00W","sessionID":"ses_f9761531dffeO0JQ36mOI7MVT9","type":"text","text":"I can see the bug in the Clamp function. The logic is inverted - when x is less than lo, it returns hi (should return lo), and when x is greater than hi, it returns lo (should return hi). Let me fix this:\n\n","time":{"start":1788461631653,"end":1788461632936}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788461632943,"sessionID":"ses_f9761531dffeO0JQ36mOI7MVT9","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"yJfSB8KHRFl2SdHa6xAsOWMldLHxQV92","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-u_2hzrkd\\repair.go","oldString":"func Clamp(x, lo, hi int) int {\n\tif x < lo {\n\t\treturn hi\n\t}\n\tif x > hi {\n\t\treturn lo\n\t}\n\treturn x\n}","newString":"func Clamp(x, lo, hi int) int {\n\tif x < lo {\n\t\treturn lo\n\t}\n\tif x > hi {\n\t\treturn hi\n\t}\n\treturn x\n}"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-u_2hzrkd\\repair.go\n===================================================================\n--- C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-u_2hzrkd\\repair.go\n+++ C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-u_2hzrkd\\repair.go\n@@ -1,11 +1,11 @@\n package repair\n \n func Clamp(x, lo, hi int) int {\n \tif x < lo {\n-\t\treturn hi\n+\t\treturn lo\n \t}\n \tif x > hi {\n-\t\treturn lo\n+\t\treturn hi\n \t}\n \treturn x\n }\n","filediff":{"file":"C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-u_2hzrkd\\repair.go","patch":"Index: C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-u_2hzrkd\\repair.go\n===================================================================\n--- C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-u_2hzrkd\\repair.go\n+++ C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-u_2hzrkd\\repair.go\n@@ -1,11 +1,11 @@\n package repair\n \n func Clamp(x, lo, hi int) int {\n \tif x < lo {\n-\t\treturn hi\n+\t\treturn lo\n \t}\n \tif x > hi {\n-\t\treturn lo\n+\t\treturn hi\n \t}\n \treturn x\n }\n","additions":2,"deletions":2},"truncated":false},"title":"repair.go","time":{"start":1788461632939,"end":1788461632941}},"id":"prt_0689eca33001Je827AqyvYLQli","sessionID":"ses_f9761531dffeO0JQ36mOI7MVT9","messageID":"msg_0689ec7b90019f9G